{"sha": "5cffad17dad37f9834e52e9491128fd1610db22bd93af99cc508f1510dd7bfe3", "body": ["\\chapter{傅里叶变换}\\label{ch:b3:fouriertransform}", "", "傅里叶级数把周期信号分解为离散的", "谐波；傅里叶\\emph{变换}则对", "整条实轴上的信号做同样的分解，频率取连续统。它", "把求导化为乘法，把卷积化为", "乘积，把高斯函数化为高斯函数——这正是它", "能够求解微分方程、驱动信号处理，并", "将在\\cref{ch:b3:clt}中证明中心极限定理。本章", "发展 $L^1$ 理论（黎曼–勒贝格引理、", "反演、单射性），施瓦茨函数类，在其上", "变换恰好为双射，以及 $L^2$ 理论", "（普朗歇尔：在相差一个常数的意义下，变换是一个酉", "算子），并以两个典型应用作结：热传导方程，", "在周末问题中完整求解，以及泊松", "求和公式。约定：", "\\[", "\\hat f(\\xi) = \\int_\\R f(x)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi x}\\,\\dd x .", "\\]", "", "\\section{\\texorpdfstring{$L^1$ 上的变换}{L1 上的变换}}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b3:fouriertransform:basic}", "对 $f \\in L^1(\\R)$，$\\hat f$ 良定义、有界", "（$\\norm{\\hat f}_\\infty \\leq \\norm f_1$）、连续，且：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $\\widehat{\\tau_af}(\\xi) = \\eu^{-\\iu a\\xi}\\hat f(\\xi)$", "        且 $\\widehat{\\eu^{\\iu ax}f}(\\xi) = \\hat f(\\xi - a)$；", "  \\item $\\widehat{f(\\cdot/\\lambda)}(\\xi) = \\lambda\\hat", "        f(\\lambda\\xi)$，当 $\\lambda > 0$ 时；", "  \\item 若 $xf \\in L^1$，则 $\\hat f$ 属于 $\\mathcal C^1$，且", "        $(\\hat f)'(\\xi) = \\widehat{(-\\iu x)f}(\\xi)$；", "  \\item 若 $f \\in \\mathcal C^1$ 且 $f' \\in L^1$（并且 $f \\to", "        0$ 在 $\\pm\\infty$ 处（此处自动成立），则", "        $\\widehat{f'}(\\xi) = \\iu\\xi\\hat f(\\xi)$；", "  \\item $\\widehat{f * g} = \\hat f\\,\\hat g$（$f, g \\in L^1$）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "有界性：$\\abs{\\hat f} \\leq \\int\\abs f$。连续性：由控制收敛定理（DCT）", "取控制函数 $\\abs f$（\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramcont}）。", "(1)、(2)：作变量替换", "（\\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange}）。(3)：", "积分号下求导，控制函数为 $\\abs{xf}$", "（\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramdiff}）。(4)：首先，$f(x) = f(0)", "+ \\int_0^xf'$ 在 $\\pm\\infty$ 处有极限（$f' \\in L^1$），", "该极限必为 $0$（$f \\in L^1$）；然后在 $[-A,", "A]$ 上分部积分，并令 $A \\to \\infty$。(5)：用 Fubini 定理，其合法性在于", "$(x,y)\\mapsto f(x - y)g(y)\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi x}$ 绝对", "可积（\\cref{thm:b3:product:convolution}）：", "\\[", "\\widehat{f*g}(\\xi) = \\iint f(x - y)g(y)\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi(x - y)}", "\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi y}\\dd x\\,\\dd y = \\hat f(\\xi)\\,\\hat g(\\xi).", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:b3:fouriertransform:gaussian}", "高斯函数：当 $a > 0$ 时，\\index{高斯函数, 傅里叶变换}", "\\[", "\\widehat{\\eu^{-ax^2}}(\\xi) =", "\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi a}\\;\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4a} :", "\\]", "由\\cref{exo:b3:lebesgue:7}（常微分方程 $F' = -\\frac\\xi{2}F$", "的技巧，并作伸缩），或由 (3)：$g = \\widehat{\\eu^{-ax^2}}$", "满足 $g'(\\xi) = -\\frac{\\xi}{2a}g(\\xi)$（分部积分", "）；$g(0) = \\sqrt{\\pi/a}$。高斯函数是", "变换的不动点（在相差伸缩的意义下）——这正是它们主宰", "中心极限定理的深层原因。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[黎曼–勒贝格引理]", "\\label{thm:b3:fouriertransform:riemannlebesgue}", "对 $f \\in L^1(\\R)$，$\\hat f(\\xi) \\to 0$，当 $\\abs\\xi \\to", "\\infty$ 时。于是 $\\widehat{\\phantom f} \\colon L^1 \\to \\mathcal", "C_0(\\R)$（连续且在无穷远处趋于零的函数", "）。\\index{黎曼–勒贝格引理}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对区间的示性函数，$\\widehat{\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc", "ab}}(\\xi) = \\frac{\\eu^{-\\iu a\\xi} - \\eu^{-\\iu b\\xi}}{\\iu\\xi}", "\\to 0$，故对阶梯函数成立。阶梯函数在", "$L^1$ 中稠密（\\cref{thm:b3:lp:density}(1)，加上", "有限测度集由有限个区间的并逼近，", "\\cref{exo:b3:measure:7}），且变换是", "$\\norm\\cdot_\\infty$-$\\norm\\cdot_1$ 连续：当 $\\norm{f -", "s}_1 < \\varepsilon$，$\\limsup_{\\abs\\xi\\to\\infty}\\abs{\\hat", "f(\\xi)} \\leq \\varepsilon$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{反演与单射性}", "", "\\begin{lemma}[乘法公式]", "\\label{lem:b3:fouriertransform:multiplication}", "对 $f, g \\in L^1(\\R)$，$\\displaystyle\\int \\hat f\\,g =", "\\int f\\,\\hat g$。", "\\end{lemma}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "两边都等于 $\\iint f(x)g(\\xi)\\eu^{-\\iu x\\xi}\\dd", "x\\,\\dd\\xi$（Tonelli–Fubini：绝对值的", "二重积分等于 $\\norm f_1\\norm g_1$）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[反演定理]\\label{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}", "设 $f \\in L^1(\\R)$。\\index{傅里叶反演定理}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item （高斯可和性）对每个 $x$，", "        \\[", "        (f * g_\\varepsilon)(x) =", "        \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_\\R \\hat f(\\xi)\\,", "        \\eu^{-\\varepsilon\\xi^2}\\,\\eu^{\\iu x\\xi}\\,\\dd\\xi,", "        \\qquad\\text{其中 } g_\\varepsilon(y) =", "        \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{\\pi\\varepsilon}}\\,", "        \\eu^{-y^2/4\\varepsilon},", "        \\]", "        且 $f * g_\\varepsilon \\to f$（在 $L^1$ 中），当 $\\varepsilon", "        \\to 0$。", "  \\item 若又有 $\\hat f \\in L^1$，则对几乎处处的", "        $x$", "        \\[", "        f(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_\\R \\hat", "        f(\\xi)\\,\\eu^{\\iu x\\xi}\\,\\dd\\xi ,", "        \\]", "        且 $f$ 有一个连续代表元。", "  \\item （单射性）若 $\\hat f = 0$，则 $f = 0$ 几乎处处。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}